window.products.push({"id":883190,"name":"Aunt (rose gold)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91HfEij+ZFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Whether it’s for Christmas, New Year, Thanksgiving or a Birthday – looking for a present specifically for your aunt is a challenge! If she enjoys a nice drink to relax and clear her mind or perhaps a hot coffee to get through a late-night meeting then our wine tumbler is worth it. Aside from the adorable appearance of our stemless wine tumbler, its personalized message will make your recipient feel special, loved and appreciated! Made from 18/8 stainless steel, this stainless wine tumbler is not limited to wine alone, but is perfect for all the other beverages that they enjoy. This can keep their libations very chilled – be it their wine, a margarita or just simply water. It can also retain the heat of their morning coffee on the go or for that water that’s always on their bedside table. It can retain the drink's temperature for up to 12 hours! If you’re looking for a mother’s day gift for an aunt or a best aunt ever kind of gift then this auntie mug is the answer. Let her sip back and relax as your aunt elevates her drinking experience with our Wine Tumbler. Product Specifications: Vacuum-Sealed Lid BPA- and Lead-Free Double-Walled No Taste Transfer No Condensation 18/8 Stainless Steel Includes Splash-Proof Lid","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91HfEij+ZFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blue Moon Ideas Inc","source_asin":"B08CS37LPQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-883190","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CS37LPQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CS37LPQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
