window.products.push({"id":883266,"name":"Chefman Food Dehydrator Machine, Touch Screen Electric Multi-Tier Preserver, Meat or Beef Jerky Maker, Fruit Leather, Vegetable Dryer w/ 6 Slide Out D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":88.7,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XbhBHIQAL._AC_SL1309_.jpg","description":"FAST, EASY WAY TO MAKE DELICIOUS AND HEALTHY NATURAL SNACKS. With the Chefman 6 Tray Touch Screen Food Dehydrator, you can easily make jerky, fruit rolls, veggie chips – all delicious, and without any preservatives. It’s great if you’re in charge of snacks in your household, are a health-conscious eater or simply love knowing exactly what’s in your food. For those who love dehydrated treats but hate the hassle, this easy-to-operate auto-dehydrator is the perfect treat – simply slice, season, and snack on something deliciously healthy. Digital temperatures preset settings ranging from 95º F to 158º F, integrated with a countdown timer up to 19. 5 hours, provides accurate drying times and temperatures to make it super easy for you to start creating delicious dried fruit, homemade granola bars, trail mix, beef jerky, dried herbs, fruit snacks, and more! The transparent viewing window allows you to keep an eye on your food as it dehydrates without opening the door. As easy to clean as it is to use, the removable trays are top rack dishwasher safe. Making delicious dehydrated delights has never been so easy! Trying to cut down on food waste? Dehydrate stale snacks like crackers and cereal to give them brand new texture and crunch. Get as creative as you want and use the dehydrator to dry flowers for potpourri, make edible cake decorations or garnish for cocktails.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XbhBHIQAL._AC_SL1309_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chefman","source_asin":"B07B9KZXLS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-883266","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07B9KZXLS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07B9KZXLS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
