window.products.push({"id":883321,"name":"Kitchen Utensils Set, Umite Chef 22Pcs Silicone Cooking Utensils Set, Heat Resistant Silicone Kitchen Spatulas Set with Holder, Cooking Gadgets Tools ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WifTnmfrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【FOOD GRADE SILICONE BPA FREE!】Each cooking utensil is made entirely of food-grade silicone, BPA-free and odorless, We know that this is a health issue that concerns you and your family, and it is also the most important concern for every consumer. So We strictly control the production and quality of these cooking utensils. NOTE: It must be soaked for half an hour when it is used for the first time, and then exposed to the air for about 3 hours, the original smell of silica gel will disappear 【STAINLESS STEEL CORE & NO GAPS, ONE PIECE DESIGN】Each cooking utensils has a stainless-steel core to ensure long-term deformation and durability. Soft silicone outer layer will not scratch your pan, At the same time, the silicone with a fine particle feel is also anti slip, providing you with a comfortable grip. The stainless steel is wrapped in silicone to form a whole seamless silicone design, You don't need to worry about cleaning issues caused by any welding seams 【HIGHLY HEAT RESISTANT】One of the best things about Umite Chef silicone spatula kitchen utensils is its ability to withstand heat safely, each utensil is heat-resistant up to whopping 446°F and won’t melt (even leave it in the pot for a while) and our spatula head won't even become knicked or warped even at those extreme temperatures. This silicone cooking utensils does not react with food or beverages, Will not retain odors or colors when you use it for stirring based food products 【 EASY TO CLEAN &100% DISHWASHER SAFE】Seamless silicone design which is a major plus as there aren't any cracks or ridges to catch food or harbor anything that makes it super easy to clean. The sturdy silicone surface eliminates the worry about damage caused by machine washing to the product, Just put it in the dishwasher after use, and you will get a new set. This cookware utensils set has everything you need, It’s an ideal gift for Mother’s Day, Christmas, as a housewarming present and more. 【VERSATILE 22PCS KITCHEN UTENSILS SET】we have selected this 22PCS silicone cooking utensil sets for you that is dedicated to cooking. This means you don’t have to spend extra money on repetitive utensil tools. Essential kitchen Tools Includes 1 x Ladle,1 x Pasta Fork,1 x Spoonula, 1 x Slotted Spoon,1 x Kitchen Tong,1 x Slotted turner,1 x Whisk,1 x Brush,1 x Large Spatula,1 x Small Spatula,1 x Egg Separator,1 x Holder, 5 x measuring spoons, 5 x measuring cups","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WifTnmfrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Umite Chef","source_asin":"B0C2ZFC3K5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-883321","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2ZFC3K5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2ZFC3K5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
