window.products.push({"id":883372,"name":"Savvanti Rose Gold Wine Tumbler with Spill Resistant Lid | 12 Ounce Double-Walled Insulated Stainless Steel | The Ecofriendly Choice for Portable Wine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719Lm2DxlXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Savvanti Spill Proof Travel Tumbler Savvanti’s simple, smooth stainless-steel tumbler is the perfect glass for your next adventure. This portable glass is ideal for camping, pool parties, recreational vehicles, picnics, and more. Unlike most wine tumblers, we designed a spill-resistant lid that is easy to open, close, and remove. For hot or cold beverages. Keeps drinks cold for up to INSERT TIME, hot beverages for up to INSERT TIME. 12 oz / 350 ml CAPACITY. For hot or cold beverages. Keeps drinks cold for up to INSERT TIME, hot beverages for up to INSERT TIME. 12 oz / 350 ml CAPACITY. TOP-RACK DISHWASHER SAFE for each clean up. TOP-RACK DISHWASHER SAFE for each clean up. 100% BPA FREE, LEAD-FREE, nontoxic, and safe. 100% BPA FREE, LEAD-FREE, nontoxic, and safe. RUSTPROOF 304 18/8 food grade Stainless Steel construction that won’t alter or contaminate flavors. RUSTPROOF 304 18/8 food grade Stainless Steel construction that won’t alter or contaminate flavors. A GREAT GIFT IDEA for friends and family, especially wine and outdoor enthusiasts. A GREAT GIFT IDEA for friends and family, especially wine and outdoor enthusiasts. Made from shatterproof stainless steel, these stemless glasses can be used for wine, cocktails, beer, or whiskey and are virtually unbreakable! This wine tumbler is power coated to minimize fading and chipping and provides a solid anti-slip, anti-sweat grip. The Savvanti Story Our passion for travel has taken us all over the world—from Southern Europe to South America, Minnesota to San Diego—and we love enjoying amazing food and drinks along the way. Savvanti is the curation of great drinkware and cookware that we use in our daily lives to connect with friends and family over a delicious meal and drinks. We hope our products inspire you to enjoy life to the fullest! Savvanti, for a savory life. Cheers! Andy & Jeanette","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719Lm2DxlXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Savvanti","source_asin":"B07D3X3WDJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-883372","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D3X3WDJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D3X3WDJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
