window.products.push({"id":883424,"name":"Atelier Home Linen 4-Piece Bedding Sets - 100% Cotton Bed Sheets and Pillow Covers - Luxury 800 Thread Count Sateen Weave - Non-Wrinkle, No Fade, Deep","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QSkk3z93L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Having difficulty sleeping lately? The skies are dark. You lie in bed, wearing your most comfortable pajamas. Tired from a long day, you close your eyes hoping to doze off the moment you do...but you don't./br> You twist and turn, changing the position of your pillows while you're at it. Clearing your mind, you try again. After several minutes, you grunt in frustration. You're still awake and you know the reason why. Your scratchy bed covers and pillowcases are irritating! Start sleeping better with the luxury and comfort of Atelier Home Linen Cotton Sheet Set! The set includes 2 pillowcases, 1 bed sheet and 1 deep pocket sheet. All are sateen woven, single hem stitched, and made from 100% long-staple combed cotton grown in the Indian tropics. Each piece is guaranteed soft and smooth. With a 800 thread count, one of the highest on the market, it will wear well and become shinier over time. Our fabric is dyed with IMaster H20 to protect from shrinkage and fading. It also contributes to the cloth’s hypoallergenic quality. When washing, you can avoid wrinkling by drying naturally on the clothesline. Or tumble dry, sprinkle a few drops of water, and iron. At Atelier, we work from a 3rd generation factory with humble beginnings but can now compete with giant companies. We prefer not to mass produce to ensure that all our products pass the strictest standards before being delivered. Here are more reasons to love our cotton bedding set: ✨ Comes with a FREE hand towel ✨ Like hotel bedding, colors are solid without patterns or designs ✨ Choose from white, sky blue, beige, dark grey and dark lavender ✨ Sizes available: Twin, Queen, King, California King ✨ 100% money-back or replacement warranty! Enjoy well-deserved sleep every night. Add Atelier Home Linen Cotton Sheet Set to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QSkk3z93L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Atelier Home Linen","source_asin":"B07CWS69WG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-883424","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CWS69WG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CWS69WG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
