window.products.push({"id":883459,"name":"Hand painted glow in the dark graveyard scene white wine goblets. set of 4 20 ounce red wine gobblets. usa, Blacklight keychain included","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EE1tLYnuL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Hand painted set of 4 goblets. Hand Painted in fun spooky Halloween graveyard scene. (Blacklight keychain included) And guess what!!!!! The ring around the moon, pumpkins eyes and spiders eyes all glow in the dark. You do need to charge them up in the light for sun to get the glowing effect though. I recommend charging it up with a black light though. Blacklight keychain included . But the other ways do charge it but just takes longer. Let the haunting season begin. Too much fun. 20 ounce white wine goblets non toxic, dish washer top rack safe. Painted to order. Paint baked on for permanence.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EE1tLYnuL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B07HCX8FJ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-883459","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HCX8FJ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HCX8FJ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
