window.products.push({"id":883501,"name":"Sterktlys Wood Stove Fan, 4-Blade Heat Powered Stove Top Fan with Temperature Label, Magnetic Stove Thermometer, Efficient Heat Distribution & Silent ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61V20hEQgPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Heat Powered, No Electricity, Automatic Working】The stove fan does not require additional electricity or batteries, and is powered by heat. Put the stove fan on the stove steadily. When the fan base is heated to 158°F (70°C), the fan will automatically start and work normally. As the stove heats up, the fireplace fan runs faster. Effectively dispersing warm air around your room. It's a real energy saving and eco friendly wood stove accessories in winter. 【Temperature Label Added, Upgraded Overheat Protection】We have added a thermal temperature label on the top of the heat powered stove fan to real-time monitor the surface temperature of the fan radiator. Together with the magnetic stove thermometer that we presented to you in the package, double protection of your fireplace fan. (Note: The normal working environment temperature of the stove fan: 158°F-653°F) 【Silent Running, Low Noise(＜32dB)】The newly designed blade surface is polished to reduce resistance. The upgraded motor allows the stove fan to running more smoothly, stably, quietly and comfortably. While ensuring the wind speed, this stove fan works with a low noise of less than 32dB, providing you with a quiet guarantee for reading and working, and filling the warm air around the room. 【Anodized Aluminum Material & 4-Blade Design 】The body of the stove top fan is made of anodized aluminum, which can withstand high temperatures up to 653°F (345°C), and will not be deformed or discolored even if it works for a long time at high temperatures. High-strength metal 4-blade design, strong wind output, stable structure, not easy to be deformed by heat. 【Compact Design】The size of this heat powered stove fan is about 7 *3 *7.5 in, portable and fit narrow spaces. Ideal for wood-burning stoves, cast iron wood stoves, soapstone wood-burning stoves, gas stoves, pellet stoves, etc. 【What You Get】1x Sterktlys 4-blade heat powered stove fan with Temperature Label, 1x stove thermometer, 1x user manual. We provide you with 3 years of product quality service, and 100% satisfaction customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61V20hEQgPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sterktlys","source_asin":"B09FT3NP27","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-883501","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FT3NP27","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FT3NP27","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
