window.products.push({"id":883565,"name":"Houkois Alarm Clocks for Bedroom, Cute Kitty Digital Alarm Clocks with USB Charger Kawaii Room Decor Desk Clock for Gentle Wake Up, Sunrise Alarm Cloc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XwhHTGv+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⏰ Light-sensitive LED Display. The military time is more accurate and clear than old ones. The brightness of the time display will be changed by the degree around.And alarm clock has mute pace to sleep faster. ⏰ Night Light & Bedside Lamp.You can press the ☀ button to change the brightness, including strong, medium or low light mode. Night light is soft and not dazzling. Light source is even and comfortable, like a delicious dish in the bowl, it shines to attract cats from afar. ⏰ Snooze and Vibration Sensor.Firstly, the clock has 24 hour display only.Secondly, built-in snooze function, a total of 3 rings alert you to start a fresh day, which caters to a smart humanized one.Thirdly is virbration reaction, LED time will light up when you pat the clock or desktop.Besides,time display will be off automatically after 30s. ⏰ Battery Large Capacity.The product has a built-in 1500mAh battery, which can be recharged. There is no need to reset the time when power is cut off. The package contains a USB cable, which can be connected to a computer or adapter (within 5V) is used for power supply. ⏰ 𝟏𝟎𝟎% 𝐒𝐀𝐓𝐈𝐒𝐅𝐀𝐂𝐓𝐈𝐎𝐍 𝐆𝐔𝐀𝐑𝐀𝐍𝐓𝐄𝐄. Best gift for all people and perfect for home bedside office table decoration or daily use.Our products are worthy and you will get the same as looking in the images.Customer satisfaction is our first priority.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XwhHTGv+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Houkois","source_asin":"B08YQTF64D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-883565","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YQTF64D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YQTF64D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
