window.products.push({"id":883823,"name":"Pizza Cutting Board 12\"x16\" Fiber Pizza Peel Paddle Serving Boards with Handle for Pizzas Bread Baking Fruit Vegetable and Cheese","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7160A2oi4dL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"STURDY FIBRE MATERIAL:The pizza peel paddle is made of fiber,can do a very good oil decontamination,has super evaporation ability to keep its surface dry. Prep, cut and serve on peel surface,won't crack or warp. The peel is 12*16 inches,the perfect size and durable design that can stand up to the rigorous daily use of any busy kitchen. MULTI-PURPOSE FUNCTIONALITY:Our fiber pizza peel and cutting board is versatile. In addition to helping get your pizzas in and out of the oven, it serves as a beautiful cutting board or chopping block for your pizza, fruits, or vegetables. It also functions as a simple serving tray for you to serve your pizza, vegetables, fruit, or cheese. Lastly, it serves as a beautiful decoration that can be displayed in your kitchen or bar. HEAT-RESISTANT:The serving board surfaces are heat-resistant up to 350°F(176°C), so you can use the surface as a trivet on a dining table or buffet without leaving a blemish.Not microwave safe and should not be used as cookware.Both sides of the pizza board work equally well for food preparation,the board can also be used as a serving tray when offering cheese and crackers or other hors d'oeuvres to guests at a party. EASY GRIP HANDLE AND EASY TO CLEAN: It’s made even easier with the handle's contoured design. It makes food preparation and baking fun and simple.In addition,cleaning is a breeze. Just rinse off your bamboo wooden pizza peel in warm soapy water and towel dry or air dry. DISHWASHER-SAFE:Unlike wood and bamboo cutting boards, pizza spatula cutting surfaces are high-quality food-prep surfaces that can be cleaned in the dishwasher.Easy to clean,easy to maintain.Best Gift for Thanksgiving Day,Christmas","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7160A2oi4dL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SHANGPEIXUAN","source_asin":"B07T1HN11K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-883823","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07T1HN11K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07T1HN11K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
